  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/17ee53f0aa3cebaac16ad79ae2fa79e562336dde52fe9a4fd41bdb0c7ce4a2a3.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n1) **−, +, ÷, ×, =**\n\n→ 13 - 7 + **12 ÷ 4** × 15 = 65\n\n→ 13 - 7 + **3 ×**** 15** = 65\n\n→ **13** - 7 **+ 45** = 65\n\n→ 58 - 7 = 65\n\n→ 51 ≠ 65\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n2) **+, ÷, ×, +, =**\n\n→ 13 + **7 ÷ 12** × 4 + 15 = 65\n\n→ 13 + **7/12 ×**** 4** + 15 = 65\n\n→ **13 + 7/3 +**** 15** = 65\n\n→ 91/3 ≠ 65\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n3) **+, +, ÷, ×, =**\n\n→ 13 + 7 + **12 ÷ 4** × 15 = 65\n\n→ 13 + 7 + **3 ×**** 15** = 65\n\n→ **13 +**** 7 + 45** = 65\n\n→ 65 = 65\n\n→ **LHS = RHS** ⇒ **Satisfies the equation.**\n\n4) **+, ×, ÷, ×, =**\n\n→ 13 + 7 × **12 ÷ 4** × 15 = 65\n\n→ 13 + 7 × **3 ×**** 15** = 65\n\n→ 13 + **7 × 45** = 65\n\n→ **13 + 315** = 65\n\n→ 328 ≠ 65\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"****+, +, ÷, ×, =\"**.",
